Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Test Narset's reflexive discard damage

The discard trigger announces its own target and uses the discarded card's mana value.

Analogues: Seasoned Cryomancer's discard-this-way trigger and Vivien's Invocation's this-way referent.
Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
